<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2772" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίζω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτέω</span> (not in <i><span class="en">
			Il.
		</span></i>, once in <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
		</span></i>); only pres. (exc. aor.
		part.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίσσας</span> in <i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			10.66
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Agath.
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ask, beg</i>, c. acc.
			rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον . . αἰτίζων κατὰ δῆμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.558
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				222
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡνίκ᾽ ἂν αἰτίζητ᾽ ἄρτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					120
				</span></i>
			 (hex.); generally, <i>ask</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρευ τέκος ὅσσ᾽ ἐθελημὸς αἰτίζεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. pers.,
				<i>beg of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίζειν . . πάντας ἐποιχόμενον
					μνηστῆρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.346
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> abs.,
			<i>beg</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίζων βόσκειν ἣν
			γαστέρα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				228
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				4.651
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
